  "intent": {
    "architecturalIdea": "One broad inhabited civic plinth grows into an offset high office trunk and an asymmetric elevated dining crown; a large three-dimensional sky atrium subtracts volume while maintaining other enclosed office bays.",
    "publicExperience": "The route is a chain of urban threshold, sheltered two-story civic hall, vertical atrium and high sunlit office floors leading to a displaced top restaurant, all tied to measurable actual volumes rather than applied ribbons.",
    "nextReview": "Test supported three-cell headroom for purpose-zones and evaluate multi-view architectural coherence; a large atrium must not consume all usable office floors or turn the building into a gate."
